		<profileDesc>
			<abstract>
				<p>Greetings SIGIR Members! SIGIR in Washington DC was a success. A big thank you to the general chairs Sam Han, Hongning Wang, and Grace Hui Yang, for putting on a great conference, in an amazing city. The conference featured some exciting &quot;firsts&quot; (LLM Day chaired by Paul Bennett, Julia Kiseleva and Yue Wang and Government Day chaired by Jason R. Baron and Ian Soboroff) that added current and local focus to the program. Thank you to the Program Chairs Claudia Hauff, Guido Zuccon and Yi Zhang for the excellent technical program! 2024 was a big year for awards. We would like to congratulate the Best Paper Award winners</p>
			</abstract>
